      "text": "The heartbroken Colorado team watched their season unravel as the bond was broken by injury, losing both a fallen star and an injured talent. From the ashes of a mid-season firing, a coach forged a winning record, guiding his team through playoff runs and a decisive series sweep. This painful journey culminated in a devastating, complete defeat, a final, crushing rupture that ended their championship dreams on the ice.",
