    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The victors, a professional sports team, achieved the ultimate union with the Cup by conquering a wounded rival. Their championship series qualification was built upon a masterful coaching performance, a series of tactical victories, and a crushing defensive performance that silenced a league-leading offense. Their path was paved with the heartbreak of others, a perfect, complete triumph forged in the crucible of the conference final.",
